{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Do you have what it takes to design and build space colonization stations fit for each critical situation you will face ?</i>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time and Space Legacy is a puzzle game where you need to find the right solution for every challenge thrown your way. Depending on the space available, the resources at your disposal, and the upcoming events, you have to make the right decisions to reach your mission objectives. To do so, you have access to a wide array of tools and actions to help you create the ideal station of your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You've been given a mission</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931220/extras/f032c4306f50575293a09d1c20658c38.poster.avif?t=1765194198\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931220/extras/f032c4306f50575293a09d1c20658c38.webm?t=1765194198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931220/extras/f032c4306f50575293a09d1c20658c38.mp4?t=1765194198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a space station director, tasked with making key decisions that will shape the outcome of space colonization missions. As the sole authority on board, it's up to you to design and deploy stations adequately, considering time and space constraints unique to each mission. Will you priorize oxygen farms to ensure survival, or focus on industrial development to start the production of the crucial module needed for your mission ?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You hold all the power</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931220/extras/459950885dba148ced917e6046498c9e.poster.avif?t=1765194198\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931220/extras/459950885dba148ced917e6046498c9e.webm?t=1765194198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931220/extras/459950885dba148ced917e6046498c9e.mp4?t=1765194198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the station director, you'll manage every aspect of your space station. You'll decide which district to build, destroy or move; oversee factories and choose which modules to produce; plan strategies that will lead your colony to success. The key lies in managing your resources efficiently: these are extremely scarce, and you'll often need to produce them yourself or trade them with other stations to meet your needs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You have time on your side</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931220/extras/50f97d326696bff829f422f6d6138597.poster.avif?t=1765194198\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931220/extras/50f97d326696bff829f422f6d6138597.webm?t=1765194198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931220/extras/50f97d326696bff829f422f6d6138597.mp4?t=1765194198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your greatest advantage without hesitation: time travel technology. You'll be able to go back and revise past decisions, optimizing your colony to overcome the toughest challenges. You can even rely on retro-temporalization, and send resources to the past to fulfill otherwise impossible commitments...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you make the right choices?</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931220/extras/8070dfcd2ff5d0d6a1b83a882b8f1355.poster.avif?t=1765194198\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931220/extras/8070dfcd2ff5d0d6a1b83a882b8f1355.webm?t=1765194198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931220/extras/8070dfcd2ff5d0d6a1b83a882b8f1355.mp4?t=1765194198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout your missions, you'll meet enigmatic characters and face critical choices that will dramatically shift the balance, steering humanity toward a brighter future... or a far more perilous one...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >May your decisions shape a briliant tomorrow !</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"One small step for man","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3931220/82b77a7049b2a624b897f24d0ad264fe19ef33d0.jpg"},{"name":"Time travel","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3931220/58c1b82de05964f21e6f3bef6e34723a07927a6d.jpg"},{"name":"Outlaw","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3931220/7148b561aaa03eea38d2d42ad48248b932cb6a08.jpg"},{"name":"Trust science","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3931220/f4e22e6a25a5ec7fd4e7c3501c6b2672cbceb2dc.jpg"},{"name":"Trust hierarchy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3931220/728d553ac12bbeae006b8eb0de2943f88d162a1e.jpg"},{"name":"Best workforce in the whole universe","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3931220/3b8447d898a6a275c3a617d6457ff8d6e028419d.jpg"},{"name":"Trust the queen","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3931220/c9c5b366f959eebf6f6885cb071bd2d5449aea2e.jpg"},{"name":"Trust the counselor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3931220/fe47ea64e24cd0b282a46143d073016e867e6c1e.jpg"},{"name":"Peace in the station","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3931220/bb467fdb36b9651274bba2af902caee1137d9f3d.jpg"},{"name":"Trust Workists","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3931220/2a2cc546c25d1b9588bd90248762c38e54c90250.jpg"}],"total":18},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3931220?t=1765194198","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3931220?t=1765194198","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931220/1a9cb5218f8d468260f26d6786a990451776a83a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765194198","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931220/1a9cb5218f8d468260f26d6786a990451776a83a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765194198","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3931230,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Do you have what it takes to design and build space colonization stations fit for each critical situation you will face ?</i>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time and Spa